Z||000003||artherd||08-08-2001||06:44 AM||||Hi Tony, choping the top on a spaceframe car like the fiero is no mean feat, you'd be amazed what has to be cut and re-aligned :)   That said, take a look at the writeup at v8archie.com  if you still want to tackle it, by all means go for it man!!!<P>I'm planning on dumping a Northstar V8 into my formula very shortly (already have the engine, gee it's pretty!)  <P>One suggestion for your car; Wheels.<BR>The Fiero loves a good set of 17" wheels with sticky rubber.  really.<P>PS: maybe intrested in that 420sel, email me asking price-range?<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
Z||000004||cardealer||08-08-2001||11:57 AM||||would love to have archie do the top but he is so far away from me. <P>maybe 16" or 17" rims in the future, but i dont want to increase the gear ratio by using a taller tire. it hooks up pretty well now, but when i do the top i certinly will get some better looking rims and tires.<P>one of my benz's (the 420) will be going on ebay maybe today or in the next few days, i will expect around $7500.00 to $8000.00. but if you want to make an offer let me know. <BR>thanks!||||reg||10
Z||000005||isthiswhereiputausername?||08-08-2001||06:31 PM||||The car looks great!..<P>Question though..  The fan on the hood, Does it help with the cooling much?<P>||||reg||1
Z||000006||cardealer||08-08-2001||08:56 PM||||i assume it does... the air feels like a hair drier on nitrous out the back of the cowl. it pulls a lot of air but i really find it usefull after i shut the engine off. my temp go's up to around 250 or so and if i leave the fan on for about 10 minutes after i shut it off it cools down much faster. i think i am going to try a CSI waterpump as i still have some over heating problems during all these 100+ degee weather we are having here.<P>anybody do their own choptop ??????????||||reg||6
