Z||000010||Pontiaddict||08-09-2001||06:13 PM||||I wouldn't say that you have to have Archie do it, He's just had more experience at it.<BR>It would be a waste to have such a nice car sitting in body shop limbo. (is that a chop top pun?) You might want to get a cheap Fiero frame for them to practice on. That way they can get some experience before doing any irreversable damage to a car that is worth something. Plus you can make the chop top frame driveable and make some money on it if they get it right<BR>||||reg||1
